  "body": {
    "title": "DaemonSetupPolicy.decide — pure probe×consent mapping",
    "summary": "Implement decide(state: DaemonState, consented: Boolean): DaemonSetupAction as a pure total function over the closed union: CURRENT -> NoOp (either consent); ABSENT/!consented -> OfferSetup(INSTALL); ABSENT/consented -> RunSilently(INSTALL); STALE/!consented -> OfferSetup(UPDATE); STALE/consented -> RunSilently(UPDATE). Consumes sc2's DaemonState (never re-implements the probe). No IO.",
